WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.980
In 431, a Church council at Ephesus
defended a Greek title for Mary: Theotokos,

2
00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.230
God-bearer.

3
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.990
Catholics and Orthodox use it to this day,

4
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.070
and many Anglicans and
Lutherans accept it too.

5
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.620
To a newcomer, the English
version can sound startling:

6
00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.290
Mother of God.

7
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.870
So what does that title
claim, and what doesn't it?

8
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.610
In this mission, you'll
follow Mary's story,

9
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.230
from Nazareth to the foot of the cross.

10
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.270
Then you'll see how Catholics
pray with Mary today,

11
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.900
and why other Christians
see her differently.

12
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:38.530
Your mission: find out what the
title Mother of God really claims.
